subtasks.description:
In `review-actions.ts`, update both `autoReviseSpec` and `rejectTask` to reset ALL retry counters together in a single point.

Currently these functions reset `qaAttempt = 0`. Extend them to also reset:
- `pipeline.deliverableFailCounts = {}` (empty object, not undefined)

Also verify that `wakeupAttemptCount` (from ADR 002) is reset at the same hook. If not yet added, add `pipeline.wakeupAttemptCount = 0` alongside the others.

**Pattern (in both autoReviseSpec and rejectTask):**
```ts
// Reset all retry counters — fresh spec/rejection gets a clean budget
pipeline.qaAttempt = 0;
pipeline.deliverableFailCounts = {};
pipeline.wakeupAttemptCount = 0;
```

This ensures consistency per AC 9: all counters reset together on human intervention, not scattered across multiple files.
